er Key?</strong><br><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Candidates need their&nbsp;<strong>Registration Number / Roll Number</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Password / Captcha</strong> to download the Answer Key<strong>.</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is BPSC Official Website?<br></strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of BPSC is https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
